shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121530/extras/66489168dec0690e9b0a660a8df576ab.mp4?t=1779651557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Almanac, conversations are part of the investigation. You can type or speak your own questions instead of choosing from a fixed list of dialogue options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ask where someone was. Press them about a contradiction. Show them a photograph. Bluff, flatter, accuse, or earn their trust. Some witnesses open up if you treat them gently. Others only reveal the truth when cornered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121530/extras/7b077b3d39a36e7789c5883a5847502e.avif?t=1779651557\" alt=\"Solve Hand-Crafted Cases\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121530/extras_big/7b077b3d39a36e7789c5883a5847502e.webp?t=1779651557 width=1560 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121530/extras/742203a703901f0aea79d24e0e940c35.poster.avif?t=1779651557\" aria-label=\"Image shows: Different puzzles, assembling a newspaper, opening a safe, looking at a playing card\" width=1170 height=682 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121530/extras/742203a703901f0aea79d24e0e940c35.webm?t=1779651557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121530/extras/742203a703901f0aea79d24e0e940c35.mp4?t=1779651557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some cases are small and personal. Some lead into stranger corners of the town. Some seem unrelated at first, until you start noticing the same names, symbols, and secrets appearing again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you dig, the more Almanac starts to feel less like a town full of isolated cases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121530/extras/1b19b7c1a8d6fd7f8812d472060e91c0.avif?t=1779651557\" alt=\"Present Your Theory\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121530/extras_big/1b19b7c1a8d6fd7f8812d472060e91c0.webp?t=1779651557 width=1560 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121530/extras/ecbf33e82d04bf2a0e80208aea31d25f.poster.avif?t=1779651557\" aria-label=\"Image shows: Courtroom Investigation\" width=1170 height=682 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121530/extras/ecbf33e82d04bf2a0e80208aea31d25f.webm?t=1779651557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121530/extras/ecbf33e82d04bf2a0e80208aea31d25f.mp4?t=1779651557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you believe you know the truth, build your case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect the suspect, location, method, motive, and evidence. Then present your accusation and defend it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Almanac, solving a case is about proving that your version of events is the one that fits the evidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121530/extras/5040db51e3b18ca2aa044f48f111d6ac.avif?t=1779651557\" alt=\"A Town Full of Secrets\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121530/extras_big/5040db51e3b18ca2aa044f48f111d6ac.webp?t=1779651557 width=1560 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121530/extras/de61ae0c54628b3ee79138950fb56db1.poster.avif?t=1779651557\" aria-label=\"Image shows: Different crime scenes\" width=1170 height=682 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121530/extras/de61ae0c54628b3ee79138950fb56db1.webm?t=1779651557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121530/extras/de61ae0c54628b3ee79138950fb56db1.mp4?t=1779651557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind every door is a potential lead. A bartender may know who was seen late at night. A doorman may remember who entered the building. A nervous witness may know more than they are willing to admit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121530/extras/19e76d8a34f449d307e235750893b7ed.avif?t=1779651557\" alt=\"Grow Your Detective Agency\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121530/extras_big/19e76d8a34f449d307e235750893b7ed.webp?t=1779651557 width=1560 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121530/extras/6959fb4e2a83ee2cd49aa1d9775345a4.poster.avif?t=1779651557\" aria-label=\"Image shows: Detective Agency\" width=1170 height=682 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121530/extras/6959fb4e2a83ee2cd49aa1d9775345a4.webm?t=1779651557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121530/extras/6959fb4e2a83ee2cd49aa1d9775345a4.mp4?t=1779651557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your reputation spreads as you solve cases. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your agency grows, you gain access to more complex cases, more influential clients, and more dangerous secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And somewhere beneath it all is the reason your friend disappeared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The longer you stay in Almanac, the more the town opens up - and the harder it becomes to leave. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121530/extras/477008040706dc0a288e467224284c4f.poster.avif?t=1779651557\" aria-label=\"Image shows: Player pets a cat\" width=1170 height=682 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121530/extras/477008040706dc0a288e467224284c4f.webm?t=1779651557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121530/extras/477008040706dc0a288e467224284c4f.mp4?t=1779651557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A narrative detective game about solving mysteries through investigation, evidence, and conversation. Question suspects in your own words, photograph clues, and piece together the truth in a town full of secrets. Who is lying, and what are they hiding?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121530/71e4a6612d9346a6f60f34b6cd1654b9d0ae955c/header.jpg?t=1779651557", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121530/fff2d1a74e4b61a65c6039cdab76dbe411dd5e88/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779651557", "capsule_ima